│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ vectorized_lpt_packing                                                                    │
│ patch_description        │ Replace the nested Python implementation of cardinality-constrained LPT packing with a    │
│                          │ batched tensor implementation across all MoE layers.                                      │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The existing policy already uses a strong greedy heuristic: process experts/groups in     │
│                          │ descending load order and place each into the currently least-loaded pack that still has  │
│                          │ capacity. However, it executes this independently for every layer using Python lists,     │
│                          │ Python `min`, generator expressions, and repeated scalar tensor accesses. This is         │
│                          │ particularly expensive because each scalar access creates substantial framework overhead. │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The replacement preserves the same greedy packing policy and deterministic lowest-index   │
│                          │ tie breaking, but maintains pack loads and capacities as `` tensors. Each sorted-item     │
│                          │ position is assigned for every layer at once using `masked_fill`, `min`, and `scatter`    │
│                          │ operations. Besides substantially reducing algorithm execution time, avoiding CPU-only    │
│                          │ state makes the helper usable efficiently if load metrics are retained on an accelerator  │
│                          │ in future callers.                                                                        │
