│ patch_description        │ This implementation replaces hierarchical group packing and Python-level greedy loops     │
│                          │ with a two-stage global optimization strategy:                                            │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 1. **Vectorized water-filling replica allocation**: all possible additional replicas are  │
│                          │ scored by their resulting per-replica load (`weight / replica_count`). Selecting the      │
│                          │ largest marginal loads produces the same minimax-style replica allocation objective as    │
│                          │ repeatedly duplicating the most overloaded expert, but performs the selection in a        │
│                          │ batched Torch operation.                                                                  │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 2. **Capacity-constrained LPT GPU placement**: after replication, physical expert copies  │
│                          │ are sorted by load and assigned using Longest-Processing-Time scheduling to the currently │
│                          │ least-loaded GPU with remaining capacity. This directly optimizes GPU balance while       │
│                          │ preserving exactly the required number of expert slots per GPU.                           │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The algorithm removes CPU Python loops over groups and experts, avoids intermediate       │
│                          │ hierarchical permutations, and directly balances the physical expert loads across all     │
│                          │ GPUs.                                                                                     │
