│ patch_name               │ swap_refine_packing                                                                       │
│ patch_description        │ Add a small batched pairwise-swap refinement after cardinality-constrained LPT packing.   │
│                          │ LPT is fast and provides a strong initial makespan solution, but it can leave avoidable   │
│                          │ variance when two items assigned to different packs can be exchanged. The refinement      │
│                          │ evaluates all cross-pack swaps in parallel for each layer and applies only the best       │
│                          │ variance-reducing swap per layer for a bounded number of passes.                          │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This preserves the exact number of items per pack, keeps the algorithm deterministic, and │
│                          │ improves GPU/node load balance without changing replica counts or topology constraints.   │
│                          │ The bounded number of tensorized passes avoids the high execution cost of an unbounded    │
│                          │ local-search procedure.                                                                   │
