│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ bounded_swap_polish                                                                       │
│ patch_description        │ Add a small bounded local-search refinement after the batched LPT packing pass. LPT       │
│                          │ provides a fast initial feasible assignment, but it can leave avoidable imbalance when a  │
│                          │ heavy item in the most-loaded pack can be exchanged with a light item in the least-loaded │
│                          │ pack.                                                                                     │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The refinement performs at most four batched exchanges per row, preserves the exact       │
│                          │ per-pack capacity constraint, and only accepts an exchange when it strictly reduces the   │
│                          │ maximum load of the affected pair. Since the number of rounds is constant and operations  │
│                          │ are fully vectorized across layers, this adds little planner overhead while improving     │
│                          │ both node-group and GPU-level placement quality. Replica ranks are exchanged together     │
│                          │ with their items so the returned pack/rank representation remains a valid permutation of  │
│                          │ slots.                                                                                    │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
