│ patch_type               │ full                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ refined_hierarchical_eplb                                                                 │
│ patch_description        │ This redesign separates placement into reusable planning stages and introduces a          │
│                          │ capacity-preserving local-swap refinement after greedy LPT packing.                       │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The new structure uses:                                                                   │
│                          │ - A reusable equal-cardinality packing primitive which produces physical-slot layouts     │
│                          │ directly.                                                                                 │
│                          │ - Batched greedy replica water-filling for logical expert replication.                    │
│                          │ - A bounded batched swap-refinement pass for node and GPU packing. It swaps expert groups │
│                          │ or replicas between the most-loaded and least-loaded packs when doing so reduces their    │
│                          │ load gap, improving balance beyond one-pass LPT without expensive global optimization.    │
│                          │ - Explicit layout conversion helpers for inverse permutations and reverse-map             │
│                          │ materialization.                                                                          │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The refinement is bounded to a small fixed number of rounds, maintaining predictable      │
│                          │ execution time while improving GPU and node-level balance in cases where greedy placement │
│                          │ leaves beneficial swaps available.                                                        │
