│ patch_type               │ full                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ waterfill_exchange                                                                        │
│ patch_description        │ This implementation keeps the fast batched hierarchical structure from the prior          │
│                          │ programs—group placement to nodes, water-filling replica allocation within nodes, and     │
│                          │ equal-cardinality GPU placement—but replaces the packing refinement strategy with a       │
│                          │ targeted exchange method.                                                                 │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The new packing method starts with efficient cardinality-constrained LPT scheduling, then │
│                          │ performs a very small number of price-guided exchanges. Rather than evaluating every      │
│                          │ item-pair swap quadratically, it identifies overloaded and underloaded packs, computes    │
│                          │ the ideal load transfer for each pack pair, and uses sorted candidate weights plus binary │
│                          │ search to find the nearest useful exchange. This retains fixed slot counts while reducing │
│                          │ residual GPU imbalance at substantially lower cost than exhaustive swap search.           │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Replica counts remain allocated by batched water filling, which directly minimizes the    │
│                          │ largest expected per-replica expert load under the fixed physical-expert budget. The      │
│                          │ final reverse map is materialized exactly as required by the original API.                │
